{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["How was land usually divided in the medieval 3-field system?","One-third of a manors land was cultivated with wheat, one-third with barley or other crop, one-third was left for meadows. Every year the fields were rotated."],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"history\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
